@startuml
title Sockbuster - Vista de Desarrollo / Prototipo estático
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "GitHub Pages / Frontend" {
  [Inicio (index.html)] as Home
  [Catálogo (catalogo.html)] as Catalog
  [Administración demo (admin.html)] as Admin
  [Documentación UML] as Docs
  [app-static.js] as App
  [admin-static.js] as Edit
  [store-local.js] as Store
  artifact "productos.json" as JSON
}
database "localStorage del navegador" as Local
Home --> Catalog
Catalog --> App
Admin --> Edit
App --> Store
Edit --> Store
Store --> JSON : fetch / solo lectura
Store --> Local : Lectura / escritura local
note right of Local
  Los datos no se comparten
  entre usuarios o dispositivos.
  No hay backend ni JWT.
end note
@enduml
